{"id":"445412","name":"蜜汁山药羹","author":"tgcyy","authorId":"7015271","desc":"","cover":"images/445412/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"山药","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"枸杞","amount":"少许"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"1汤匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备原料。","img":"images/445412/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"山药去皮切片，泡进水里，防止氧化变黑。","img":"images/445412/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮锅加水，加少许糖。","img":"images/445412/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入山药，煮。","img":"images/445412/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"碗里放入玉米淀粉、枸杞，少许水，拌匀。","img":"images/445412/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"山药煮熟。","img":"images/445412/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入碗汁，煮至汤汁粘稠即可关火。","img":"images/445412/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"晾至温热，按您口味加适量蜂蜜即可享用。","img":"images/445412/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"蜂蜜不太甜，加糖是为了增加甜度，您也可以只加蜂蜜调味。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}